# python-u: u on a method. The picker lists the declarations first and the tests last, the
# counts in its title, each row in the colours of the line it quotes (#7); Enter opens a row.
# D finds a class of the project by a few letters of its name.
merl app/repos.py
wait class OrderRepo:
key t /
type save(
key Enter u
wait Usages of save: 2 declarations, 2 in code, 1 in tests (5/5)
key Down*4 Enter
wait tests/test_service.py  21:
key D
type unitof
wait app/uow.py:4
key Enter
wait app/uow.py  4:
